    "rule": "Take two A arms as an unordered pair and one B arm. Glue all roots, aligning the high endpoint of each A arm with the low endpoint of the B arm; no root ears."
  },
  "two_branches": {
    "arms_A": [
      0,
      1
    ],
    "rule": "Take an unordered pair of unordered A-arm pairs. Align low-low and high-high within each pair. Add an initial central triangle and r>=0 degree-six strip steps, then glue the second pair crosswise. The exact construction is in exact_odd_enumeration.md."
  },
